        {
          "name": "Rain Woods",
          "title": "Board Member",
          "photo": "~/assets/images/Catherine-W_headshot-300x294.jpeg",
          "bio": "Rain Woods is the child of long-time ECRS love-birds Steve & Martha Woods, and a member from childhood. As an adult, they have regularly led crafts and dance classes and are always looking for an opportunity to goof around. Outside of camp, they spend their time working as an urban farmer in Chicago, IL, where they live with their partner Alice."
        },
        {
          "name": "Fern Lox",
          "title": "Board Member",
          "photo": "~/assets/images/Phlox-headshot.jpg",
          "bio": "Fern has been an ECRS member for over 25 years when a friend realized that she needed to have more fun. She was hooked from her first Stony Point weekend! Fern is retired from a career in public K-12 education as a teacher, staff developer, and administrator."
